==== Overclocking ====
As default the CPU is clocked to 256 MHz. By moving two resistors we can set the frequency to 300 MHz:

{{media:comtrend:ct-5361_overclk.jpg?direct&400|}}

These resistors are connected to both the flash chip and the miniPCI, they are 10 kohm (01C marking) pulldown resistors. 
  * Move **AD27 to AD28**, and **AD30 to AD29**. After this change you should see these kernel messages: \\ ''[    0.000000] CPU frequency is 300 MHz
[    0.000000] Calibrating delay loop... 297.98 BogoMIPS (lpj=595968) ''
